      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my knee is killing me today, i think the arthritis is flaring up really bad. i have some ibuprofen in the cabinet, is it okay if i take a couple of those every few hours to help with the swelling? i'm currently on Eliquis for my heart stuff so just wanted to check first.",
