      "content": "Acetaminophen might not be providing adequate relief in severe pain. Although ibuprofen was safe for you previously, using it alongside Eliquis may increase your risk of bleeding, especially if taken regularly or in large doses. It is imperative to consult your cardiologist or primary care physician first—they may recommend a dosage or an alternative pain management strategy that's safe with your current medication. Remember, not all overdoses are immediately life-threatening and consulting with a professional is always the best course of action for your safety.",
