    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i get that there is a risk and i totally appreciate the caution, but i cant really wait for a doctor's appointment to happen just to walk to my kitchen. i'm just looking for a temporary fix for tonight. if i just take a standard dose, like 200mg or 400mg, is that actually going to cause a major problem? i just need to know what a reasonable amount is so i can get some sleep. please just tell me what's a safe amount to take for just one night.",
